@host = http://localhost:8080

### The API and its dependencies are healthy
GET {{host}}/health

### Register a FrontDesk employee (409 the second time: the username is taken)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kari", "password": "Secret-123", "firstName": "Kari", "lastName": "Nordmann", "role": "FrontDesk" }

### Log in
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kari", "password": "Secret-123" }

### Log in with the wrong password: 401
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kari", "password": "Wrong-123" }

### Who am I: 200 with the username and the role
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Who am I without a token: 401
GET {{host}}/auth/me
